(CONFIDENTIAL - Project description for cantonal promotion agencies) Tj T*
(Project ref. DEMO-2026-0417. Invented demo case, no real company or person.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Kestrelyn Health Oy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The company) Tj T*
(Kestrelyn Health Oy was founded in 2021 in Tampere, Finland, and employs 26 people. It builds) Tj T*
(Kestra, a thin skin patch that continuously measures interstitial glucose and lactate in women) Tj T*
(during endurance sport. The patch pairs with a phone app that adapts training load and) Tj T*
(carbohydrate intake in real time. A first version is used by 400 amateur athletes in a pilot) Tj T*
(study in Finland and Sweden.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We are passionate about empowering every woman to reach her full potential, and we believe) Tj T*
(Kestra will revolutionise women's health. Our world-class team combines Nordic design with) Tj T*
(cutting-edge science.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Why Switzerland) Tj T*
(The company is comparing Switzerland, Germany and the Netherlands for a European R&D and) Tj T*
(clinical base, to open in 2027. Its next product, for women who have type 1 diabetes, needs) Tj T*
(clinical evidence and a regulatory pathway in Europe.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Financials) Tj T*
(Revenue 2025: EUR 1.4 million. Shareholders: founders 58%, a Nordic seed fund 31%, employees) Tj T*
(11%. Current valuation: EUR 22 million.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What the company is looking for) Tj T*
(- Clinical validation of the patch with women who have type 1 diabetes, including how glucose) Tj T*
(  and lactate change across the menstrual cycle and during exercise.) Tj T*
(- A research partner in biosensors, signal processing and machine learning to improve the) Tj T*
(  glucose and lactate algorithms.) Tj T*
(- Access to a clinical trial unit that can run a GCP compliant medical device study for CE) Tj T*
(  marking under the EU MDR.) Tj T*
(- Cleanroom and microfabrication capacity for prototyping the next generation of microneedle) Tj T*
(  sensors.) Tj T*
(- Non-dilutive funding for a joint R&D project with a Swiss research partner, for example) Tj T*
(  through Innosuisse.) Tj T*
(- Licensing options for university technology in sweat-based or microneedle sensing.) Tj T*
(- A contract manufacturer for flexible electronics and patch assembly in Switzerland.) Tj T*
(- Hiring around 10 people in the first two years: firmware engineers, data scientists and) Tj T*
(  regulatory affairs specialists.) Tj T*
(- About 400 m2 of lab and office space close to a university hospital.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Timeline) Tj T*
(The location decision is expected in Q2 2027. The CEO plans to visit two or three Swiss cantons) Tj T*
(in spring.) Tj T*
ET
